<title>UK: B.Aerospace up on Eurofighter,NatWest buy not.</title>
<headline>B.Aerospace up on Eurofighter,NatWest buy not.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Aerospace Plc rose for a second session on Thursday amid hopes the Eurofighter project would soon be funded, dealers said.</p>
<p>Also contributing to the advance was a positive comment from NatWest, which reiterated a strong buy note, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0756 GMT, the shares were up 28-1/2p to 1281 in a generally weaker market.</p>
</text>
